    "操作前确认": "Confirm before operation",
    "操作员从可用工作站列表中确认作业地点，选择目标站点后进入工作站首页，开始处理分配到该站点的现场任务。": "The operator confirms the work location from the list of available workstations, selects the target site and enters the workstation homepage to start processing on-site tasks assigned to the site.",
    "操作员在工作站输入容器条码并发起呼出后，系统启动容器呼出流程，将指定容器送往工作站。": "After the operator enters the container barcode at the workstation and initiates an outbound call, the system starts the container outbound process and sends the designated container to the workstation.",
    "操作员按商品维度发起呼出后，系统启动商品呼出流程，将存放该商品的容器送往工作站。": "After the operator initiates an outbound call based on the product dimension, the system starts the product outbound call process and sends the container storing the product to the workstation.",
