    "更新站点列表和使用状态，确保选择基于最新信息。": "Update site list and usage status to ensure selections are based on the latest information.",
    "有结果时，每组会显示 APPEND 或 CREATE_NEW，说明任务将追加到现有实例还是新建流程。": "When there are results, each group will display APPEND or CREATE_NEW, indicating whether the task will be appended to an existing instance or a new process.",
    "本规则实际匹配到的任务数和分组数，用于核对 Filter 与 Grouping Attributes 是否符合预期。": "The number of tasks and groupings actually matched by this rule is used to check whether the Filter and Grouping Attributes meet expectations.",
